{"title": "Adamantine Shield (passive feature)", "pageid": 28302, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adamantine_Shield_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Adamantine Shield</b> is a passive feature that sends attacks reeling.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a melee attack misses you, the attacker is sent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reeling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> for 2 turns. \n</p><p>Reeling creatures have a -1 penalty to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> for every turn remaining.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_MeleeDebuff_AttackDebuff1_OnDamage_Shield_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_MeleeDebuff_AttackDebuff1_OnDamage_Shield_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_MeleeDebuff_AttackDebuff1_OnDamage_Shield_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Reeling\"> Condition: Reeling </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reeling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Recovering from receiving a terrible blow or hitting a strong metal. Has a -1 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> for every turn remaining.</li>\n<li>Reeling has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\">Adamantine Shield</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reeling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> condition clears when the reeling creature makes any attack roll, regardless of target or success.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201804\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2009/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20616/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5310/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 941803/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.136      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   61.136      1 -total\n 20.00%   12.229      1 Template:Cond\n 19.73%   12.061      4 Template:Icon_text\n 18.77%   11.475     17 Template:Trim\n 18.52%   11.321      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.36%   10.615      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 16.78%   10.259      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 13.86%    8.471      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 13.41%    8.196      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28302-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201804 and revision id 391256. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}